    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2782600/extras/478d7a6bc103dc7adfc24127e26a6863.avif?t=1754456356\" width=600 height=280 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Poorzzle: Puzzle Alive (The Art of Immortality)</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Without being puzzled, how can you\u00a0be\u00a0enlightenment?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the vast expanse of the void, puzzles shimmer like celestial stars, radiating the light of pure intellect. Poorzzle: Puzzle Alive isn't just a\u00a0abstract\u00a0puzzle game; it's an experience reserved for those who demand more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Pinnacle of Experience:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Minimalist Artistry:</strong> </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Clean lines carve out pure geometric beauty. The puzzle design? Think abstract art, where elegance meets ingenious design. It's not just visuals, it's a statement. </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Profound Puzzles:</strong> </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >24 meticulously crafted puzzles, like timeless gems, waiting for your discovery. And then, there are 10 hidden levels, for those with the true intellect to explore.   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2782600/extras/48a6a5a1a04ee70b21c308fefd0c158c.poster.avif?t=1754456356\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2782600/extras/48a6a5a1a04ee70b21c308fefd0c158c.webm?t=1754456356\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2782600/extras/48a6a5a1a04ee70b21c308fefd0c158c.mp4?t=1754456356\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Pursuit of Immortality:</strong> </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You'll step into the role of a savior, breaking the seals of prophetic shards, seizing the key to immortality. This isn't merely gameplay; it's a quest for eternal truth, guided by the witness of God. </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Dialogue of the Mind:</strong> </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No bloodshed, no tedious journeys. Just you and the puzzles, a pure conversation of minds, a constant elevation of thought. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2782600/extras/0ba27832c6b808baaadf77c89bc7d6f0.poster.avif?t=1754456356\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2782600/extras/0ba27832c6b808baaadf77c89bc7d6f0.webm?t=1754456356\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2782600/extras/0ba27832c6b808baaadf77c89bc7d6f0.mp4?t=1754456356\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mystic Powers:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Precognition:</strong> </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your intuition will transcend the ordinary, seeing the causal links behind the puzzles, navigating through the haze. </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Insight into Truth:</strong> </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your perception will pierce through the surface, hitting the core,\u00a0revealing the hidden principles in the puzzles. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    <strong>\u2022 Boundless Imagination:</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your imagination will break free, finding answers in infinite possibilities, discovering your moments of epiphany. </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Divine Favor:</strong> </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On the path to truth, you\u2019ll find that Lady Luck has taken a liking to you. </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Challenge Your Limits:</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every attempt, every setback, is a step on the ladder to enlightenment. Don't give up easily, because true wisdom often lies at the edge of despair. May the key to immortality always be with you, making every challenge a cherished memory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Poorzzle:\u00a0Puzzle\u00a0Alive. Embark on an immortal journey of intellect and delight. Here, you'll transcend yourself, touching eternity.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Without being puzzled, how can you be enlightened?</strong></h2>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2782600/extras/478d7a6bc103dc7adfc24127e26a6863.avif?t=1754456356\" width=600 height=280 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Poorzzle: Puzzle Alive (The Art of Immortality)</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Without being puzzled, how can you\u00a0be\u00a0enlightenment?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the vast expanse of the void, puzzles shimmer like celestial stars, radiating the light of pure intellect. Poorzzle: Puzzle Alive isn't just a\u00a0abstract\u00a0puzzle game; it's an experience reserved for those who demand more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Pinnacle of Experience:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Minimalist Artistry:</strong> </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Clean lines carve out pure geometric beauty. The puzzle design? Think abstract art, where elegance meets ingenious design. It's not just visuals, it's a statement. </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Profound Puzzles:</strong> </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >24 meticulously crafted puzzles, like timeless gems, waiting for your discovery. And then, there are 10 hidden levels, for those with the true intellect to explore.   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2782600/extras/48a6a5a1a04ee70b21c308fefd0c158c.poster.avif?t=1754456356\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2782600/extras/48a6a5a1a04ee70b21c308fefd0c158c.webm?t=1754456356\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2782600/extras/48a6a5a1a04ee70b21c308fefd0c158c.mp4?t=1754456356\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Pursuit of Immortality:</strong> </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You'll step into the role of a savior, breaking the seals of prophetic shards, seizing the key to immortality. This isn't merely gameplay; it's a quest for eternal truth, guided by the witness of God. </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Dialogue of the Mind:</strong> </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No bloodshed, no tedious journeys. Just you and the puzzles, a pure conversation of minds, a constant elevation of thought. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2782600/extras/0ba27832c6b808baaadf77c89bc7d6f0.poster.avif?t=1754456356\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2782600/extras/0ba27832c6b808baaadf77c89bc7d6f0.webm?t=1754456356\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2782600/extras/0ba27832c6b808baaadf77c89bc7d6f0.mp4?t=1754456356\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mystic Powers:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Precognition:</strong> </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your intuition will transcend the ordinary, seeing the causal links behind the puzzles, navigating through the haze. </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Insight into Truth:</strong> </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your perception will pierce through the surface, hitting the core,\u00a0revealing the hidden principles in the puzzles. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    <strong>\u2022 Boundless Imagination:</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your imagination will break free, finding answers in infinite possibilities, discovering your moments of epiphany. </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Divine Favor:</strong> </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On the path to truth, you\u2019ll find that Lady Luck has taken a liking to you. </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Challenge Your Limits:</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every attempt, every setback, is a step on the ladder to enlightenment. Don't give up easily, because true wisdom often lies at the edge of despair. May the key to immortality always be with you, making every challenge a cherished memory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Poorzzle:\u00a0Puzzle\u00a0Alive. Embark on an immortal journey of intellect and delight. Here, you'll transcend yourself, touching eternity.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Without being puzzled, how can you be enlightened?</strong></h2>",
